#: ../../source/user-guide/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Per-tool reference: modes, options, inputs, outputs, and examples for each "
"of the three programs, plus the R/Python scripts around them. New to "
"`cneta`? Start with [Quick start](../quickstart/index.md) first — this page "
"is for once you're past that and need the details for a specific tool."
msgstr ""
"各工具的说明：三个程序各自的运行模式、参数、输入、输出和示例，以及配套的 R/Python 脚本。第一次使用 "
"`cneta`？请先看[快速上手](../quickstart/index.md)；本部分适合在那之后查某个工具的细节。"

